We checked the works records. The crew had been replacing older pipework.
The records show several pressure drops on a main supplying the affected
area during the night of 11-12 December.

I can confirm the dates and the main involved. I am checking the service
area against our network drawing. I cannot yet confirm from the works
record whether the day-care centre (DC-01) and the apartment building
(APT-01) were served by the same section of main.

